{"data":{"body":"[P2] Enforce the deadline on in-flight reads. `await operation()` has no timeout, so a stalled SDK request can exceed the 120/300/900-second phase budget indefinitely, while a response arriving after the deadline is still accepted as success. Pass an `AbortSignal` with the remaining monotonic-time budget into each `lambdaClient.send` and reject results completed after expiry.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74o7xi","finding_digest":"4e9d9300a7deccc22415b491c3f6edf191c4f141b295c3832f340266ea477966","finding_id":"arf_v1_j2ozgafh33gmejavwsi4h5xn6g","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/deploy-lambda.ts::runwithretry::phase-deadline-enforcement","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/deploy-lambda.ts::runwithretry::phase-deadline-enforcement","line":291,"observation_digest":"6c611edfca8a4cbcb3a4ac22b0f93d9f7c161f43bac126ef50d9645e00986a45","observation_id":"aro_v1_nrqr5x6krjglzm5evqrlb6j5t5","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/deploy-lambda.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T03:12:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lsdekpnja7xsx4sbjao3m2bba2","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"51875c406cfd257441486ec9455dbace14209702","reviewer":"codex","start_line":291,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":964},"record_id":"art_v1_g2jzsssj7klqnrmwjan2fs4oux","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T03:12:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
